// Common NTT test data for kyber
// n=256 modulus=3329 root=17 n_inverse=3316 width=24
// cases=20; testcases 1-15 are forward NTT
// testcases 16-20 are inverse NTT
// Each testcase stores input vector followed by expected output vector.
// Hex values are for $readmemh; decimal comments are for humans.

